@startuml network-boundary-adapter
title Network Boundary — Adapter Strategy

skinparam backgroundColor #eaedf1
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #3b82f6
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #3b82f6
skinparam participantBorderColor #1e2d3d
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #0d1117
skinparam participantFontColor #f1f5f9
skinparam noteBorderColor #1e2d3d
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #0f1623
skinparam noteFontColor #9ca3af

participant "API\n(REST)" as REST
participant "API\n(WebSocket)" as WS
participant "Validator\n(optional Zod)" as VAL
participant "Adapter\nfunction" as ADAPT
participant "Frontend\ndomain model" as MODEL
participant "React\nstate" as REACT

== REST hydration (GET /entities/live, GET /alerts) ==

REST -> VAL : wire JSON (DTO)
VAL -> VAL : parse against schema\ndiscard + log on failure
VAL -> ADAPT : validated DTO
ADAPT -> ADAPT : map field names\nnormalise nulls\nderive computed fields
ADAPT -> MODEL : TrackedEntity | Alert
MODEL -> REACT : setEntities / setAlerts

note over ADAPT
  last_seen_ms (REST) and timestamp_ms (WS)
  both map to eventTimeMs in the domain model.
  React never sees wire field names.
end note

== WebSocket live update ==

WS -> VAL : wire frame (DTO)
VAL -> VAL : parse against schema\ndiscard + log on failure
VAL -> ADAPT : validated DTO
ADAPT -> MODEL : TrackedEntity | Alert
MODEL -> REACT : applyEntitySnapshot / write by alert_id

note over REACT
  applyEntitySnapshot: accept only if
  eventTimeMs > stored (monotonicity guard).
  write by alert_id: idempotent dedup.
end note

== Malformed frame (discard path) ==

WS -> VAL : malformed / unexpected JSON
VAL -> VAL : validation fails — log warning with raw frame
note right of VAL
  Frame is dropped.
  React state is never touched.
  Malformed data cannot reach the UI.
end note

@enduml
